          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plan reajustado: la próxima semana son %@ (antes %@), porque la anterior hiciste menos. Lo que no hiciste no se recupera.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plan readjusted: next week is %@ (was %@) because you did less last week. What you missed isn't made up."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Planen justerad: nästa vecka blir %@ (tidigare %@), eftersom du sprang mindre förra veckan. Det du missade tas inte igen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plan revisado: vas según lo previsto y la próxima semana sigue igual.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plan reviewed: you're on track and next week stays the same."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Planen granskad: du ligger enligt plan och nästa vecka blir oförändrad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Planificado para la fase %lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
